message: "If you use EBaMl in your work, cite it with the metadata in this file."
title: "EBaMl: BAML for Explainable Boosting Machines"
abstract: "EBaMl lets a large language model describe and explain Explainable Boosting Machines. It is a port and extension of TalkToEBM."
